..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ARTIKEL.TBUMERK.BN
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Zeigt die Sachmerkmal-Submaske zu einem Artikel an.
..                  Wenn der Artikel keine Sachmerkmalleiste hat,
..                  passiert nichts.
.. Functionality  : Displays characteristics bar sub mask for a product.
..                  If product has no characteristics bar, nothing happens.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. product must have a characteristics bar defined,
.. otherwise we cannot display characteristics
.continue END        ? M|tsach = ""
..
.. open product mask, but keep that window invisible
.. open sub mask with the characteristics bar from that invisible window
.. the sub mask is opened by pressing the button 'bmerk' on the product mask
.. <Teil>'id'<zeigen>? bmerk= | [invisible]=1
.command -parallel 'F|formatstr("<(Part)>{1}<(View)> ? bmerk= | [invisible]=1", M|tartikel^id)'
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
